2 CONC hagen, died 10 April 1826).
2 CONT * 2.3.1. Pauline Charlotte Marie, born 25 September 1764 at Copenhagen, christened 29 September 1764 at the German Garrison church, died 27 August 1836 at Kristianssand, married 17 February 1790 at Aaehus to general Christian Ditl
2 CONC ev Adolph Arenfeldt (born 11 February 1758 at Flensborg, died 10 June 1833 at Kristianssand).
2 CONT * 2.3.2. Frederik Hans Walter Harbou, born 27 October 1765 at Copenhagen, died 23 August 1832 at Slesvig, buried 26 August 1832, married 30 December 1801 at Frederiksborg church to Ane Marie Prætorius (born 23 February 1777 at Chr
