2 CONT * 3.2. Anna Birgitte, christened 4 April 1718 at St. Marie church, Helsingør, died 22 February 1766 at Rendsborg, married 1740 captain Johan Georg Ziegenhorn (died 7 September 1745 at Rendsborg).
2 CONT * 3.3. Andreas, christened 22 January 1720 at St. Marie church, Helsingør, died young.
2 CONT * 3.4. Sophie Elisabeth, born 21 May 1721 at Helsingør, christened 6 June 1721, married 1744 lieutenant Christian Maule (died 16 February 1754).
