2 CONT * 4. Andreas Harbou, christened 2 February 1696 at Glückstadt, died 23 December 1745, married 2 May 1736 at Nykjøbing to Magdalene Dorothea Neve (christened 26 December 1717 at Nicolai church, Copenhagen, died 1747). 4.1. a son, b
2 CONC orn 1737, died young.
2 CONT * 4.2. Peder Harbou, born 1738, died after 1781 at Aabenraa.
2 CONT * 4.3. Niels Harbou, born about 1739, died 7 May 1761 at Holsten.
2 CONT * 4.4. Christian Harbou, born about 1743, died 25 September 1812 at Orkedal, married 1stly 1765 Gjertrud Andrea Tromp (born 1734 at Børsen, died 22 November 1778 at Eide, Tingvold); married 2ndly 29 May 1789 at Frue church, Trondh
2 CONC eim, to Birgitte Cecilie Clausen (christened 28 May 1762 at Fruke church, Trondheim, died 7 February 1832 at Orkedal).
2 CONT * 4.4.1. *by 1* Andreas Harbou, born 1707, died 12 February 1788.
