2 CONT * 5. Cathrine Elisabeth, died 28 March 1762 at Aalborg, married 15 September 1718 at the citadel church, Copenhagen, married 15 September 1718 at the citadel church, Copenhagen, to colonel Gustav Joachim Michaelsen (died 5 Februar
2 CONC y 1749 at Aalborg).
2 CONT * 6. Anna Sophie, born 1 Januaty 1704 at Rendsborg, died 9 April 1753 at Rendsborg.
2 CONT * 7. Frederik Carl Harbou, born 26 March 1706 at Rendsborg, married 1732 the divorced wife of Peter Georg Møller.
2 CONT * 8. Christian Harbou, christened 5 September 1707 at Rendsborg, burnt to death in a house fire 24 March 1749 at Itzehoe.
