2 CONT
2 CONT  He was Rector in Kolding in 1608 and Chaplain there from 1612 until his death in Kolding, 5 December 
2 CONT 1659 and burial 21 December. He was also an astrologer and, for the last thirteen years of his life, blind. 
2 CONT He had eight children.
