1 NOTE He lived in East Halne, in Vadum parish. His brother Anders also 
2 CONT lived on the same farm, and both are mentioned as two of the four 
2 CONT freeholders in the parish in 1568. Peder Andersen Kjærulf was, 
2 CONT according to Dyreskjøt, tax collector for the township in 1570.
2 CONT He was married to Karen Bertelsdatter from Vesterbæk. They had 5 
2 CONT children: 1. Else Pedersdatter Kjærulf  2. Bertel Pederson Kjærulf 
2 CONT 3. Morten Pedersen Kjærulf  4. Anna Pedersdatter Kjærulf  5. Anne 
2 CONT Pedersdatter Kjærulf.  It was Morten Pedersen Kjærulf who was the 
2 CONT next link in the family line.
