2 CONT Karen Gyldenstierne was also known as Karen Ottes to destinguis her from her many contemporary cousins with the same name. Her husband Jørgen Marsvin (1527-81) was Lensmand at Landskrona and member of the Danish Council of State u
2 CONC ntil his death. Her cousin, Karen Gyldenstierne, was Acting County Sheriff of Bygholm 1575-76. Karen Ottes lived (1542-89).
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 1586-89 County Sheriff Karen Ottesdatter Gyldenstierne of the County of Snersted in Skåne (At the time part of Denmark, now Sweden)
2 CONT
2 CONT Karen Gyldenstierne was also known as Karen Ottes. Her husband Jørgen Marsvin (1527-81) was Lensmand at Landskrona and Member of the Danish Council of State until his death. Her cousin, Karen Gyldenstierne, was Acting County Sheri
2 CONC ff of Bygholm 1575-76. Karen Ottes lived (1542-89).
