1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Anders Ebbesen Galt''' His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-44425590 Ebbe Mogensen Galt] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-40957812 Sophie Høegh Banner]. 
