1 NOTE {geni:about_me} discussion [http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:TcyNVRQMSf0J:www.djoef-forlag.dk/media/21ecdd44-8dc3-40c9-9463-f3e6cff5e6de/Downloads/9788757401622/domme1_htm+&cd=3&hl=en&ct=clnk&gl=dk] DJOEF:
