1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *
2 CONT Margrethe Ovesdatter...
2 CONT
2 CONT When Margrethe Ovesdatter Gjedde was born in 1637, in Førslev, Sorø, Denmark, her father, Ove Brostrupsen Giedde, was 43 and her mother, Dorte Knudsdatter Urne, was 37. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Holger Vind on 21 September 1656. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 7 daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 18 January 1706, in Gjeddesdal, Greve, Roskilde, Denmark, at the age of 69, and was buried in Vor Frue, Copenhagen, Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ancestors.familysearch.org/
2 CONT **
2 CONT
2 CONT 39    Margrethe Gjedde i Kannikestræde i København. der døde 19.1.1706, opslag 283.
2 CONT Enke efter Holger Vind til Gjeddesdal [i Greve sogn] og Harrestedgård [i Hyllinge sogn], kansler, [død 1683]. Af børn angives B:
2 CONT 3) Christian Vind, amtmand
2 CONT 4) Ove Vind, oberst
2 CONT 5) Vilhelm Carl Vind.
2 CONT Afdøde døde på Gjeddesdal, [der har navn efter afdøde].
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.brejl.dk/kbhhofkoncept.html
