2 CONT
2 CONT  og Anne Vognsdatter Vognsen af Stenshede (død 23 Apr 1578, begr. i Tolstrup). 
2 CONT
2 CONT  Bodil Svendsdatter var enke 1556. Gift med Niels Griis til Slette 1532-45. (DAA1907-).
2 CONT
2 CONT  Despite the DAA source, if one examines the probable birth dates of Bodil and her supposed parents/grandparents, it shows there are difficulties with this construction. Another version of Bodil's ancestry das been attached to Nie
